       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    NWC510.
       AUTHOR.        A. WASHINGTON.
       INSTALLATION.  NORTHWIND TRADERS - DALLAS DIVISION.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  03/30/05.
      *****************************************************************
      *  EMPLOYEE TERRITORIES
      *
      *  PARAMETER: EMPLOYEE NUMBER S9(5) COMP-3 (FROM NWC200)
      *  03/30/05 AW         NEW
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DSPFILE ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-NWC510D-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RELATIVE KEY IS WS-RRN
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STAT.
           SELECT EMPTER ASSIGN TO DATABASE-EMPTER
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS ET-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-EMPTER-STAT.
           SELECT EMPMST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-EMPMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS EM-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-EMPMST-STAT.
           SELECT CODTBL ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CODTBL
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS CT-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CODTBL-STAT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DSPFILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSP-REC                     PIC X(2000).
       FD  EMPTER
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY EMPTERCP.
       FD  EMPMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY EMPMSTCP.
       FD  CODTBL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CODTBLCP.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-RRN                      PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-DSP-STAT                 PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-EMPTER-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-EMPMST-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CODTBL-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-MSG-LINE                 PIC X(78) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CODE                     PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-IND-AREA.
           05  WS-IND      PIC 1 OCCURS 99 TIMES INDICATOR 1.
       01  SFLREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-I OF NWC510D.
       01  SFLREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-O OF NWC510D.
       01  SFLCTL-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLCTL-O OF NWC510D.
       01  FMT01-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-FMT01-O OF NWC510D.
       01  ADDREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-ADDREC-I OF NWC510D.
       01  ADDREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-ADDREC-O OF NWC510D.
       01  WS-MSG-VALUES.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "EMPLOYEE NOT ON FILE".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "NO TERRITORIES ASSIGNED".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "TERRITORY REMOVED".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "TERRITORY ADDED".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "CODE NOT ON FILE".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "ALREADY ASSIGNED".
       01  WS-MSG-TABLE REDEFINES WS-MSG-VALUES.
           05  WS-MSG                  PIC X(40) OCCURS 6 TIMES.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-PARM                     PIC S9(5) COMP-3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-PARM.
       0000-MAINLINE.
           OPEN I-O DSPFILE EMPTER.
           OPEN INPUT EMPMST CODTBL.
           MOVE ALL "0" TO WS-IND-AREA.
           INITIALIZE SFLCTL-O-AREA ADDREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE LK-PARM TO EM-EMP-NO C1KEY OF SFLCTL-O.
           READ EMPMST
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO C1NAME OF SFLCTL-O
               NOT INVALID KEY MOVE EM-LNAM TO C1NAME OF SFLCTL-O
           END-READ.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD THRU 1000-EXIT.
       0100-SHOW.
           MOVE WS-MSG-LINE TO MSGLIN OF FMT01-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM FMT01-O-AREA FORMAT IS "FMT01"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-MSG-LINE.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1"
               GO TO 9000-END.
           IF WS-IND(06) = B"1"
               PERFORM 4000-ADD THRU 4000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 2000-OPTIONS THRU 2000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD THRU 1000-EXIT.
           GO TO 0100-SHOW.
       9000-END.
           CLOSE DSPFILE EMPTER EMPMST CODTBL.
           GOBACK.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-LOAD.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(31).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(32).
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE LK-PARM TO ET-EMP-NO.
           MOVE SPACES TO ET-TERR.
           START EMPTER KEY IS NOT LESS THAN ET-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 1000-DONE.
       1000-READ.
           READ EMPTER NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 1000-DONE.
           IF ET-EMP-NO NOT = LK-PARM GO TO 1000-DONE.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE SPACE TO S1OPT OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE ET-TERR TO S1CODE OF SFLREC-O H1CODE OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE "TER" TO CT-TYPE.
           MOVE ET-TERR TO CT-CODE.
           READ CODTBL
               INVALID KEY MOVE "*NOT ON FILE" TO S1DESC OF SFLREC-O
               NOT INVALID KEY MOVE CT-DESC TO S1DESC OF SFLREC-O
           END-READ.
           WRITE SUBFILE DSP-REC FROM SFLREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           GO TO 1000-READ.
       1000-DONE.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(32).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(34).
           IF WS-RRN > ZERO
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(31)
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-MSG(2) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-OPTIONS.
           READ SUBFILE DSPFILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
               INTO SFLREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               AT END GO TO 2000-EXIT.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "4"
               MOVE LK-PARM TO ET-EMP-NO
               MOVE H1CODE OF SFLREC-I TO ET-TERR
               DELETE EMPTER RECORD INVALID KEY CONTINUE END-DELETE
               MOVE WS-MSG(3) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
           GO TO 2000-OPTIONS.
       2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       4000-ADD.
           MOVE SPACES TO A1CODE OF ADDREC-O A1MSG OF ADDREC-O.
       4000-SHOW.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM ADDREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "ADDREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO ADDREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "ADDREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(51).
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1" GO TO 4000-EXIT.
           MOVE A1CODE OF ADDREC-I TO A1CODE OF ADDREC-O WS-CODE.
           MOVE "TER" TO CT-TYPE.
           MOVE WS-CODE TO CT-CODE.
           READ CODTBL INVALID KEY
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(51)
               MOVE WS-MSG(5) TO A1MSG OF ADDREC-O
               GO TO 4000-SHOW.
           MOVE LK-PARM TO ET-EMP-NO.
           MOVE WS-CODE TO ET-TERR.
           WRITE EMPTER-REC INVALID KEY
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(51)
               MOVE WS-MSG(6) TO A1MSG OF ADDREC-O
               GO TO 4000-SHOW.
           MOVE WS-MSG(4) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       4000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
